---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const updated = "November 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy notice — SimpleCISO"
  description="How SimpleCISO (Summit Cyber) handles information you send through this website."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="container-tight pt-16 pb-24 max-w-2xl">
    <span class="chip">Privacy</span>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-mono text-[color:var(--color-fg-dim)]">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)]">
      <p>
        This notice covers the SimpleCISO marketing website at <span class="font-mono">simpleciso.ai</span>,
        operated by Summit Cyber. It does not cover the SimpleCISO product application, which is
        governed by its own agreement.
      </p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          When you submit the contact form, we collect the name, work email, company, interest, and
          message you provide, plus your IP address (used only for spam rate-limiting). We do not use
          third-party advertising trackers on this site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">How we use it</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We use your submission solely to respond to your request and to follow up about SimpleCISO.
          Submissions are delivered to our team inbox by email. We do not sell your data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">Retention &amp; your choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We keep contact messages only as long as needed to handle your enquiry and our ongoing
          relationship. To ask what we hold, or to have it deleted, email
          <a href="mailto:info@simpleciso.ai" class="text-[color:var(--color-brand-blue)] hover:underline underline-offset-4">info@simpleciso.ai</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-fg)]">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions about this notice? Email
          <a href="mailto:info@simpleciso.ai" class="text-[color:var(--color-brand-blue)] hover:underline underline-offset-4">info@simpleciso.ai</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
